    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d886">

                <pb facs="0843" n="759" sameAs="frus:frus1918Supp02/pg759"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 811.203/70</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Great Britain</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Davis</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                        State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">London</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1920-01-06T12:00:00+00:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">January 6, 1920, noon.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received 11.09 a.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>23. Your 6310, December 26, 5 p.m. Foreign Office requests further information as
                    to the reasons which make it desirable, in the <pb facs="0844" n="760"
                        xml:id="pg760"/> opinion of the American Government, to proceed to the
                    elaboration of a military agreement of the sort proposed. British Government is
                    disposed to think that the conclusion of the convention at this date would not
                    be of any great utility and in order that the matter may be reexamined the
                    Foreign Office would be glad to receive further particulars as to the views of
                    the American Government in the matter.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Davis</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
